WEBVTT

00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:01.849
Tunnelning istalgan joyida, siz ustingizda
sham yoqilganligini ko’rishingiz mumkin,

00:01:01.849 --> 00:01:04.268
va uni yoqishingiz yoki
o’chirishingiz mumkin.

00:01:04.393 --> 00:01:08.523
Ular hech qanaqa qonuniyatsiz, yoqib yoki
o’chirib qo’yilgan.

00:01:08.773 --> 00:01:13.986
Tunnel bitta halqa bo’lib, qorong’ida siz
uning shakli yoki hajmini ayta olmaysiz.

00:01:14.445 --> 00:01:18.991
Siz o’zingiz bilan hech narsa olmadingiz
va qo’ygan barcha belgilaringiz yo’qoladi.

00:01:18.991 --> 00:01:20.451
Sizga strategiya kerak.

00:01:20.451 --> 00:01:23.121
Qanday qilib shamlarni sanash mumkin?

00:01:23.121 --> 00:01:25.873
Tushinib olish uchun videoni to’xtating.
Javob 3 soniyada

00:01:25.873 --> 00:01:28.167
Javob 2 soniyada

00:01:28.167 --> 00:01:30.044
Javob 1 soniyada